<h1>Verify your membership account</h1>
<p>Use this one-time link to verify your email and create the password for your <strong><%= @practice.name %></strong> membership account.</p>
<p><a href="<%= @activation_url %>">Create your password and continue to secure payment</a></p>
<p>This link expires in 30 minutes. No payment has been taken.</p>
